# gate.mjs parseReview edge cases (46f6005), ids p1-habit p2-reason p3-tip p1 p10
PASS  r3 shape (1 major + 3 minor, 1 minor open)
      defects=4 fixed=3 statuses=[minor:fixed, major:fixed, minor:fixed, minor:open]
PASS  summary line disagrees (Defects: 1) but lines + VERDICT agree
      defects=2 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed, minor:open]
FAIL  missing VERDICT
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
      problem: review/plate-review.md has no reviewer VERDICT line ("VERDICT: <n> blocker, <n> major, <n> minor") — save the reviewer's report as it answered
FAIL  VERDICT omits blocker field
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
      problem: review/plate-review.md has no reviewer VERDICT line ("VERDICT: <n> blocker, <n> major, <n> minor") — save the reviewer's report as it answered
FAIL  VERDICT says 1 major, lines list 2
      defects=2 fixed=2 statuses=[major:fixed, major:fixed]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: the VERDICT says 1 major but 2 major defect line(s) are listed — list every defect the reviewer reported, one per line
FAIL  VERDICT says 2 major, 1 listed (dropped line)
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: the VERDICT says 2 major but 1 major defect line(s) are listed — list every defect the reviewer reported, one per line
PASS  dropped line + edited VERDICT (model rewrites both)
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
FAIL  open major
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:open]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: major defect not fixed: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d — open
FAIL  open blocker
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[blocker:open]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: blocker defect not fixed: p2-reason @5s [blocker] 2: c → d — open
FAIL  "not fixed" major
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:not fixed]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: major defect not fixed: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d — not fixed
FAIL  no status on major
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d
FAIL  no status on minor
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[minor:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [minor] 2: c → d
PASS  bullet + bold id + bold severity
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
PASS  * bullet, severity without brackets
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
PASS  bold VERDICT "**VERDICT:** 0 blocker, 1 major, 0 minor"
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
PASS  bold VERDICT "**VERDICT**: …"
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
FAIL  status in bold "— **fixed**"
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d — **fixed**
FAIL  status with trailing note "— fixed (re-rendered)"
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d — fixed (re-rendered)
FAIL  status with emoji "— fixed ✅"
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: c → d — fixed ✅
PASS  ASCII " - fixed"
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
FAIL  UNMARKED major whose fix text ends "-fixed"
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:null]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: defect line has no " — fixed" or " — open" at its end: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: header floats → use the pre-fixed header
FAIL  UNMARKED major whose fix text ends "half-open" (marked fixed? no)
      defects=1 fixed=0 statuses=[major:open]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: major defect not fixed: p2-reason @5s [major] 2: door shut → draw it half-open
PASS  marked fixed but fix text ends "half-open — fixed"
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
FAIL  time range "@2.0–3.5s"
      defects=0 fixed=0 statuses=[]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: the VERDICT says 1 major but 0 major defect line(s) are listed — list every defect the reviewer reported, one per line
FAIL  time "@ 00:05"
      defects=0 fixed=0 statuses=[]
      problem: review/plate-review.md: the VERDICT says 1 major but 0 major defect line(s) are listed — list every defect the reviewer reported, one per line
FAIL  plate id case "P2-reason"
      defects=1 fixed=1 statuses=[major:fixed]
